/**
 * rapidScience - [based on rR v0.0.5-dev]
 * 
 * This game is a modification of rapidRogue (a game i'm working on) to
 * promote education of science vocabulary terms.
 * 
 * How to play:
 * - Use W, A, S, D (or the arrow keys) for movement.
 * - Aim the cursor and click to shoot a projectile to kill viruses.
 * - Answer questions during revives, waves, and more for very useful benefits.
 * 
 * This game allows the learning of the vocab terms through the following features:
 * - A dynamically created multiple-choice list of questions. (this ensures that students
 * cannot memorize the layout of questions to find the answer (as it is randomized),
 * helping to teach them the terms.)
 * - A "second chance" that allows revival of the in-game character by answering one of the
 * questions from the list from earlier.
 * - Every "wave" of a a maximum of 10 you are required to answer a question, but you
 * can also opt in to answer as many questions for shuffling your favorite upgrade.
 * 
 * This game can also be expanded to any set of lists beyond science. All that is required
 * is term and definition pairs. (i.e: "Hello" and "A formal greeting used by people.")
 * 
 * If you have any questions regarding this project please email me.
 **/

